152</doc-number><kind>A1</kind></document-id><sources><source category="X" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-10072356-A"  status="new"><document-id status="new"  format="epo"><country>JP</country> <doc-number>10072356</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="A"  name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit> <patcit ucid="US-5780445-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>US</country> <doc-number>5780445</doc-number> <kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1174140A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>CCI CORP</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUJII TOSHIAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MURASE HIRONOBU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>CCI CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJII, TOSHIAKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MURASE, HIRONOBU</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUJII TOSHIAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MURASE HIRONOBU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJII, TOSHIAKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MURASE, HIRONOBU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Skin preparations for external use which contain chromanol glycosides represented by general formula (1) wherein R&lt;1&gt;, R&lt;2&gt;, R&lt;3&gt; and R&lt;4&gt; are the same or different and each represents hydrogen or lower alkyl; R&lt;5&gt; represents hydrogen, lower alkyl or lower acyl; X represents a monosaccharide residue or an oligosaccharide residue in which the hydrogen atom in the hydroxyl group may be substituted by lower alkyl or lower acyl; n is an integer of from 0 to 6; and m is an integer of from 1 to 6. These preparations are novel preparations which are excellent in stability and transdermal absorbability, can safely exert favorable effects in a small dose and are usable in preventing and treating skin disorders. They are highly useful as preventives and remedies for disorders caused by ultraviolet light, preventives and ameliorators for skin pigmentation, skin whitening agents, skin age resistors, cell potentiators, etc.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne des préparations pour la peau à usage externe, qui contiennent des glycosides de chromanol représentés par la formule (1), dans laquelle R&lt;1&gt;, R&lt;2&gt;, R&lt;3&gt; et R&lt;4&gt; sont identiques ou différents, chacun représentant un hydrogène ou un alkyle inférieur ; R&lt;5&gt; représente un hydrogène, un alkyle inférieur ou un acyle inférieur ; X représente un résidu de monosaccharide ou un résidu d'oligosaccharide dans lequel l'atome d'hydrogène du groupe hydroxyle peut être substitué par un alkyle inférieur ou un acyle inférieur ; n est un nombre entier compris entre 0 et 6 ; m est un nombre entier compris entre 1 et 6. Ces préparations constituent de nouvelles préparations présentant une très bonne stabilité et une excellente capacité d'absorption transdermique, qui peuvent produire sans danger des effets bénéfiques à faible dose et peuvent être utilisées pour prévenir et traiter des affections de la peau. Elles sont très utiles comme moyen de prévention et de traitement d'affections provoquées par les ultraviolets, moyen de prévention et d'amélioration de la pigmentation de la peau, agents blanchissant la peau, agents contre le vieillissement de la peau, agents de potentialisation cellulaire, etc.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>